<h2 style="text-align: justify;" id="h-H2_7">Lesson 7.<br>
<strong><span style="color: rgb(47, 170, 79);">Exception Handling.&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(47, 170, 79);">Garbage C</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(47, 170, 79);">ollection&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>
