<ul style="font-weight: initial;">
<li style="text-align: justify;">The System.Exception <span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">base class</span>;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">Analysis of the hierarchy of standard exceptions;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">Inheritance and exceptions;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">Inheritance from standard exception classes.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold;">The <strong>basics&nbsp;</strong>of exception handling:
<ul style="font-weight: initial;">
<li style="text-align: justify;">The try keyword;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">The catch keyword;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">The <span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">finally&nbsp;</span>keyword;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">The throw keyword.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold;">The <strong>subtleties of exception <strong style="font-weight: 700; color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">handling</strong></strong>:
<ul style="font-weight: initial;">
<li style="text-align: justify;">Catching all exceptions;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">The&nbsp;</span>try n<span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">ested</span> blocks;</li>
<li style="text-align: justify;">Iterated generation of exceptions.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Using the checked and unchecked constructs.</strong></li>
<li style="text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Exception filters.</strong></li>
<li style="text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Using the nameof.</strong></li>
