<li style="text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;"><strong><strong style="font-weight: 700; color: rgb(63, 63, 64); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">[Serializable] and [NonSerialized] a</strong>ttributes for serialization.</strong></li>
